# Git / editor
**/.git
**/.gitignore
**/.cursor
**/.vscode
**/.idea

# Dependencies / build outputs (never ship these in the Docker build context)
**/node_modules
**/.vite
**/dist
**/build
**/.turbo
**/.cache
**/coverage
**/.eslintcache

# Local env / secrets
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example

# OS junk
**/.DS_Store
**/Thumbs.db

# Logs / temp
**/*.log
**/tmp
